# ==============================================================================
# Master SIESTA FDF Baseline (base_templates/siesta/template.fdf.base)
# Framework: Ponytail Zero-Redundancy & Literature Grounding Standard
# Grounding: [NotebookLM:dft-documentation] & SIESTA Extended Systems Memory
# ==============================================================================

# --- System & Functional Specification ---
XC.functional            GGA          # Generalized Gradient Approximation
XC.authors               PBE          # Perdew-Burke-Ernzerhof functional
PAO.BasisSize            DZP          # Double-Zeta with Polarization for realistic bonding
MeshCutoff               350.0 Ry     # Real-space integration grid cutoff

# --- SCF Convergence & Charge Sloshing Mitigation ---
MaxSCFIterations         150          # Sufficient iterations for difficult convergence
DM.Tolerance             1.0d-4       # Density matrix convergence tolerance
DM.MixingWeight          0.04         # [NotebookLM:dft-doc:Sloshing] Dampened weight prevents charge oscillations in large/2D systems
DM.NumberPulay           5            # [NotebookLM:dft-doc:Pulay] Multi-step extrapolation over 5 historical iterations

# --- Solution & Integration Options ---
SolutionMethod           Diagon       # Standard exact diagonalization
ElectronicTemperature   300.0 K      # Fermi-Dirac electronic temperature

# --- Relaxation Constraints ---
MD.TypeOfRun             CG           # Conjugate gradient structural optimization
MD.NumCGsteps            200          # Maximum relaxation steps
MD.MaxForceTol           0.02 eV/Ang  # Residual atomic force tolerance
